§§ `s 4(2): weeks earned (month = 13/3 weeks)`

`STILL` MEANS `it has not ended: I am still employed`
`MOVED` MEANS `I moved to a corporation related to my employer, which is not a termination`
`DISMISSED` MEANS `my employer terminated it, other than for serious and wilful misconduct`
`MISCONDUCT` MEANS `my employer terminated it for serious and wilful misconduct`
`NECESSITY` MEANS `I ended it because of illness, incapacity, or domestic or other pressing necessity`
`QUIT` MEANS `I ended it for another reason`
`DIED` MEANS `I died`
`FIXEDTERM` MEANS `it ended in another way, such as the end of a fixed term`
`START` MEANS `the date` 1 7 2010

-- Still employed: 10 years completed on 30 June 2020 (2 months = 26/3 weeks); the day before, nothing yet.
